    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_02",
      "hash64": "EFBD2BB47EB4A78D",
      "text": "Whoa! Where’d you come from? I didn’t even\\nnotice you there.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_03",
      "hash64": "EFBD2AB47EB4A5DA",
      "text": "Anyway, you are...?\\c\\nWait, no! Don’t say a thing! I want to guess first.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_04",
      "hash64": "EFBD25B47EB49D5B",
      "text": "You’re one of the students who came here from\\nthe Paldea region on a school trip![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_select_01",
      "hash64": "C406F9299D65C0D5",
      "text": "Bingo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_select_02",
      "hash64": "C406F6299D65BBBC",
      "text": "How’d you know?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_05",
      "hash64": "EFBD24B47EB49BA8",
      "text": "Heh heh! It’s a small town, you know. News tends\\nto spread pretty quickly![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_06",
      "hash64": "EFBD27B47EB4A0C1",
      "text": "The name’s Perrin, by the way. I’m a traveler with\\na bit of a thing for photography.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_07",
      "hash64": "EFBD26B47EB49F0E",
      "text": "This here’s my bud, Growlithe. Doesn’t the little\\nhorn on its head make it the cutest?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_dog_01",
      "hash64": "89D356223DEC9CE1",
      "text": "Grawa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_08",
      "hash64": "EFBD21B47EB4968F",
      "text": "Hey, this might sound a bit weird, but would it\\nbe all right if I took your photo?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_09",
      "hash64": "EFBD20B47EB494DC",
      "text": "Just like that, huh? Are you always this open with\\ntotal strangers? Kinda worried about you, kiddo![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_10",
      "hash64": "EFB9A3B47EB18A9E",
      "text": "Anyway, let me snap that photo.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_11",
      "hash64": "EFB9A4B47EB18C51",
      "text": "So you know better than to put too much trust\\nin a stranger you just met!\\c\\nGlad to see you’ve got a good head on those\\nshoulders, kiddo![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_12",
      "hash64": "EFB9A1B47EB18738",
      "text": "You’ve got a unique vibe, you know. I like it.\\nIt’s a bit different than what I’m used to.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_13",
      "hash64": "EFB9A2B47EB188EB",
      "text": "I’m gonna be making this town my home base for\\na little while.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_14",
      "hash64": "EFB9A7B47EB1916A",
      "text": "Why don’t you focus on wrapping up whatever\\nyou’ve got going on for now?\\c\\nCome see me after, I dunno, registering 150\\nPokémon in the Kitakami Pokédex or something![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_15",
      "hash64": "EFB9A8B47EB1931D",
      "text": "Kiddo. Look, I like your gung-ho style, but it\\nseems to me like you’ve already got something\\r\\nyou need to do, don’t you?\\c\\nGo and catch 150 Pokémon for the Kitakami\\nPokédex or something, like a good little student!\\c\\nCome gimme a holler AFTER you’ve done that—\\nnot before.\\c\\nTime is money! Don’t go wasting it![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
